  "limitations": [
    "The semantic artifact hypothesis may not be applicable to findings in central Taiwan, possibly because the contrast among seasons in Taiwan is not as great as in mid-latitude climate zones for which the hypothesis was originally proposed.",
    "The study did not attempt to fit an acceptability range around preferred temperatures, but rather estimated it based on earlier comfort research (de Dear and Brager, 1998)."
  ],
